# Before scheduling two agent tasks in parallel, check (preference)

Standing user preference: Before scheduling two agent tasks in parallel, check whether they edit any of the same files; if they share even one file, run them sequentially to avoid conflicting commits.

## Conventions
- Before scheduling two agent tasks in parallel, check whether they edit any of the same files; if they share even one file, run them sequentially to avoid conflicting commits.

